":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこのドラマ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆいぽんに昔オススメしてもらってから、ずっと見られていなくて、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと見始められました✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間を戻せるタクシーのお話で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎話違う主人公が何度かタクシーに乗って過去に戻り、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"様々な困難を乗り越えていくお話です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脚本がバカリズムさんなのです☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ全て見終わってはいないのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもおもしろいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の話はどんなお話なんだろうなーって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワクワクします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また後で寝る前に見よーっと。🛌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🌳今日あった嬉しかったこと🌳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"布団パンパンできたのでふかふかだ!🌤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤冬優花"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/236/b177d58614991cfee3dc869e4da4e.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"い"}],"source":"official"}}